      },
      "TextRenderer": {
        "text": "WASD / middle drag   Explore     /     Wheel   Zoom\nF (hold over a deposit)   Gather iron, copper or stone\nE   Inventory + crafting     /     Shift-click recipe   Craft 5\n1-6   Select building     /     Q   Empty hand\nLeft drag   Build     /     R   Rotate     /     Right drag   Remove\nClick a machine with an empty hand to access its items.\nSelect a stack, then Insert selected (Shift: 10).\n\nDrill > Belt > Inserter > Furnace > Inserter > Belt\nInserters pick up behind and drop in front.\nF5   Save     /     F9   Load     /     Esc   Close or pause",
        "fontSize": 22,
        "alignment": 0,
        "valign": 1,
        "sortOrder": 202,
